      "value": "@{59c0e5cd39a9874475bcbfd7|full_name}: IF you could guarantee that it doesn't become a micro-transaction hell where you can't just buy your way through so VRC becomes a cash cow, I'm fine with 'fake currency'. But its a very slippery slope downwards i'd say. Maybe you can do something like credits on a world for Roleplay purposes, or like an inventory system so you could stack things for an RPG styled world.",
