      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I dont know if it has been stated before but i did see a thread here that was a great start of a concept, maybe allow a 'wallet' function that would allow users to place real money in the form of a crypto currency like bit-coin or even one of this game's own making, the game would take a percentage of any given transaction, a small one of course, it would help fund the game itself and would allow people to start virtual businesses, i for one cannot create avatars or items, i simply lack the creativity and skill, but i can host exceptionally well and think i would love to run a vr bar of some kind for tips as either a suppliment to my current working pay (poor atm sadly) or, if my guests enjoy me enough, even sustain me irl. it would give rise to many great rooms i would think though it is inevitable that this type of thing would bring a rise in 'brothels' and strip joints and even casinos, though, would that be too massive of a bad thing? So long as you have to prove your age and validate your payment method for each 'tip' or payment",
      "viewerReactions": null
