      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think that would be cool. For example, years ago people have made money selling items, doing services, and/or DJing on Second Life.\n\nI probably would want it to work almost like fictional novel & movie \"Ready Player One\", where you earn credits from doing things in the Oasis (Shooting down a NPC and Enemy in a FPS world a certain amount of times), but without losing your credit if you die in-game.\n\nTo convert to real money, I do think there should be a conversation system and a minimum ($20 or more).\n\nI'm just thinking of ideas.",
